"Welcome to ES Text Editor!
 It is an immensely powerful text editor.
 It supports display of the line number;
 It supports highlighting of syntax according to different programming languages;
 It can help you finish programming.

 In addition, it can be used as an e-book reader to open TXT novels;
 It supports advanced searching, which includes regular searches, recursive searches, etc.
 It can also support calling SL4A script runs in the background.

 More advanced features are waiting for you to explore."
